extrema desde el primer d\u00eda. Sigue a Xploit ZERO en redes sociales y ay\u00fadanos a llevar la innovaci\u00f3n a\u00fan m\u00e1s lejos.", "short_description": "Xploit ZERO es el juego de acci\u00f3n y estrategia en Realidad Mixta que convierte tu habitaci\u00f3n en un campo de batalla. Piensa r\u00e1pido, construye tus defensas y reacciona en tiempo real para repeler a los invasores en partidas cortas, intensas y llenas de diversi\u00f3n. \u00bfTe atreves?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Xploit_zero_360.2.png", "id": "26529534970073330", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595136811_26529534980073329_7286307846810146766_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NYxz3hMAcGsQ7kNvwFASDHk&_nc_oc=AdrtTI7E3TrnMT_UX4n7sM_KHCNbQ-fUQq8rq0MVJkke0Dg0Ilosp02DgzE3nuDjvnc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTP_d8452yAePmUqMmNO8_5ksoAeT7VlQZMXmzewzmRQA&oe=6AEB4D56"}, {"file_name": "Shot2.png", "id": "26394552166891673", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828104_26394552180225005_6856735165680477736_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NT7MvwGLPfUQ7kNvwHN0CDj&_nc_oc=AdrQ9-vfhG3p0zyJZHMMw2YxLpAr-2HMSrz0Wl3f2pVpHf0JsY6PHhu2quax5ohXPXI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTYRouKVGQKjv_Kz4sZdL-Fy5cFYNbX6YXdQ4DaYAnA-w&oe=6AEB54A2"}, {"file_name": "Shot5.png", "id": "3160157457501506", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298502_3160157460834839_8317283677516400765_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Yr_oenr367EQ7kNvwGoadxg&_nc_oc=Ado-5l0HaE9Y4_d_bm6LGD5ReyQZA8vtdDwXpGoE_FACCGPdZmIGdjFwWfqqfeBSOZ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ3GAUY7MmDU4l-pGscTbSVkiU4wDwNsxBL00En9qyzAg&oe=6AEB5C99"}, {"file_name": "Shot3.png", "id": "2659403194432547", "image_type":